@startuml
actor User

rectangle "PresentationViewer" {
  usecase "Selecteer presentatiemap"         as UC_Select
  usecase "Laad presentatie"                  as UC_Load
  usecase "Bekijk slide"                      as UC_View
  usecase "Volgende slide"                   as UC_Next
  usecase "Vorige slide"                     as UC_Prev
  usecase "Ga naar specifieke slide"          as UC_GoTo
  usecase "Sluit presentatie"                 as UC_Close
}

User --> UC_Select
UC_Select ..> UC_Load  : <<include>>

User --> UC_View
User --> UC_Close

UC_Next   -|> UC_View : <<extend>>
UC_Prev   -|> UC_View : <<extend>>
UC_GoTo   -|> UC_View : <<extend>>

User --> UC_Next
User --> UC_Prev
User --> UC_GoTo
@enduml